        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ഗ്രഹിക്കുക",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഗ്രഹിക്കുക — grahikkuka — \"to grasp; to comprehend\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "അവൾ ആ പാഠം വേഗം ഗ്രഹിച്ചു. avaḷ ā pāṭhaṁ vēgaṁ grahiccu. She grasped that lesson quickly."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past: ഗ്രഹിച്ചു, grahiccu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A bookish word; in talk people say മനസ്സിലാക്കുക."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഗ്രഹിക്കുക (grahikkuka) is built from Sanskrit grahaṇa, \"seizing, holding\" (CDIAL 4364), with the Malayalam verb ending -ിക്കുക. To grasp an idea is to seize it, in Malayalam as in English."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for giving reasons and opinions."
            }
          ]
        },
