              "instruction": "avaḷ ā pāṭhaṁ vēgaṁ grahiccu. — She grasped that lesson quickly.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *avaḷ ā pāṭhaṁ vēgaṁ grahiccu.* — She grasped that lesson quickly.]"
